{"timestamp": 1779432725.3520076, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 27, "data": {"caller": "player_0", "reason": "Alice reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "weapons", "victim_name": "Bob"}, {"room": "medbay", "victim_name": "Frank"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779432725.3529336, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 27, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779432737.0334494, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 27, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I found Frank's dead body in medbay. My route was navigation -> storage -> lower engine -> upper engine -> medbay. I saw Frank alive earlier in navigation around tick 12. \n\nCharlie, I saw you in security and weapons very early in the round (around ticks 6-8). I have no idea where you or Eve have been recently, but since there are only three of us left, one of you has to be the Duck. Please both of you claim your routes and tell me where you've been. We cannot skip today or we lose."}}
{"timestamp": 1779432750.287159, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 27, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "My route this round was: cafeteria -> medbay -> electrical -> back to medbay -> storage -> lower engine (where I was when the meeting was called). \n\nAlice, you mentioned passing through lower engine recently, but I've been in lower engine and didn't see you at all. When exactly were you there? \n\nAlso, I was with Bob around ticks 12 to 14 in medbay and electrical, so Bob was definitely alive at that point. I didn't see Frank's body when I passed back through medbay, so he must have been killed after I left. \n\nI haven't seen Eve all round. Eve, since it's just the three of us left, it has to be either you or Alice. We need your exact route and to know if you saw anyone. Alice reporting the body could easily be a self-report to control the narrative. Let's hear what you have to say, Eve, before we decide."}}
{"timestamp": 1779432796.3820226, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 27, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I was doing a long loop: oxygen -> upper engine -> lower engine -> storage -> navigation -> security -> weapons -> back through security -> electrical -> medbay.\n\nPeople I saw: Diana early in medbay before the first meeting, Bob in weapons around tick 20, and then Frank in medbay right before this report, around tick 25. I came into medbay from electrical, and Alice came in from the upper engine side \u2014 then the report happened.\n\nSo from my view, Charlie being in lower engine actually makes sense and I don\u2019t think he could\u2019ve done this medbay kill at the end. Alice is the one who reported, came from the side of the body, and her route also doesn\u2019t line up with Charlie not seeing her in lower engine. This feels like a self-report to me.\n\nI\u2019m voting Alice."}}
{"timestamp": 1779432823.0413733, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 27, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "Eve is the Duck! When I walked into Medbay from Upper Engine, I saw Eve standing literally right on top of Frank's dead body. She even just admitted in her own speech that she was in Medbay with Frank right before the report. Charlie, if you're in Lower Engine, it has to be Eve. Please vote Eve with me!"}}
{"timestamp": 1779432921.2361364, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 27, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "Alice, your story has completely fallen apart. \n\nFirst, you claimed you saw me in Security and Weapons around ticks 6-8. That's impossible because I never set foot in Security or Weapons this entire round. I was in the Cafeteria, Medbay, and Electrical areas, and I actually saw *you* in Security and Weapons from a distance during those exact ticks. \n\nSecond, you claim your route took you through Storage and Lower Engine to get to Medbay right before this report. I literally just came through Storage and was sitting in Lower Engine when this meeting was called. If you had walked through those rooms, we would have crossed paths, but I never saw you. \n\nYou're lying about your route to cover up your tracks. Eve's observations line up perfectly with my own experience. Since it's lylo and we can't afford a mistake, I'm fully confident it's Alice. I'm voting Alice."}}
